      "case": "happy",
      "summary": "Through the bridge: alpha and bravo are listed connected. A local parent incarnation 1 has a child on bravo. bravo is frozen: a call to it ends deadline_exceeded while a call to alpha and machine.list answer and both stay listed. The parent exits; delivering its orphan notice to frozen bravo stops at its deadline and the notice stays in the outbox. bravo's line is cut and machine.list keeps it as unreachable; reconnecting replays the notice once (applied 1, outbox empty, line epoch 2) and a repeated $/orphanedAck of it is a duplicate.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "serve": {
            "fixture": "protocol"
          }
        },
        {
          "connect": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "via": "bridge"
          }
        },
        {
          "hello": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "framed": false,
            "expect": {
              "/id": "hello",
              "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000021"
